  "answer": "不相同。StructGPT 在推理时用专门接口逐步收集结构化数据中的证据，再由 LLM 基于所收集信息进行推理：“we construct the specialized interfaces to collect relevant evidence from structured data (i.e., reading), and let LLMs concentrate on the reasoning task based on the collected information” [chunk_5e3e5be8ab828aaf3e59c9fdf0aae2ad]；其结论也称先“constructed the specialized interfaces that support accurate and efficient data access”，再通过迭代调用接口推进 [chunk_bd4734d2765e2147cac924fe8ba38d85]。LPKG 则先把 KG 中的模式落地并抽取实例，再转写为自然语言问题与子问题，形成规划数据用于微调：“we start by grounding predefined patterns in an open-domain KG to extract numerous instances, which we then verbalize into complex questions and corresponding sub-questions in natural language. In this way, we effectively create a large number of accurate planning data for fine-tuning” [chunk_072d1d7f534ffdbb7644a330aeea94fa]。作者还称“after fine-tuning with planning data derived from the KG”后规划能力显著提升 [chunk_bca043f33502bdedb273cd4b0ffe1769]。因此，StructGPT 的专门接口用于推理阶段从结构化数据读取证据；LPKG 的 KG 派生规划数据用于训练阶段微调规划能力，二者知识进入系统的阶段不同。",
